WEBVTT

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.440
I need a teleport!

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.780
Teleport me out of here!

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.540
I'm being chased by a monster,
a monster I've never seen before.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.540
I can't handle it with pyrokinesis.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.290
Forget about the key!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.210
Calm down.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.540
We're opening the gate.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.500
Hurry!

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:37.760
Okay!

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.110
He didn't make it in time?

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.280
Even #5 couldn't do it...

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.640
How many of the Abe Minorus are left?

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.530
Just one, #6.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Just one...

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.380
Bunmei-kun's gonna be on TV today, right?

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:44.260
Is this the last day on Earth?

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.240
<b>July, 1999
Will the world be destroyed?!</b>

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.350
<b>The Nostradamus Prophecies
Roundtable Debate

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.760
Ami, I just got here on the bullet train.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.350
<b>The Nostradamus
Prophecies Special</b>

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.840
I know.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.280
<b>July 1999</b>

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.790
Where in Matsushiro?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.770
<b>Nagano Prefecture</b>

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.610
Waldstein Academy.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.120
Oh, Minami-Kamiyama, then.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.080
What takes you out there?

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:17.880
Now that you mention it, I heard that the
principal just died of a heart attack.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.380
There are all kinds of strange
rumors about the place.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.350
Ghosts, monsters, supernatural phenomena...

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.310
A while ago, someone said
they saw a <i>tengu</i> demon!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.770
A <i>tengu</i> demon! Seriously!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:33.190
And it's almost the 21st century.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.230
Miss...

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.610
Do you know what everyone calls that place?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.910
<i>Do you know what everyone
calls that place?</i>

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.050
Occult Academy.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.020
<b>Waldstein Academy</b>

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:37.130
We will now have a moment of silent prayer,
in memory of the principal.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.090
Be silent.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.910
I am Vice-Principal Kawashima.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:55.100
My deepest condolences.
I am truly sorry for your loss.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.610
Please, come this way.

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:08.820
She's here!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:10.920
Wow, it's been ages...

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.910
Is that her, Ami-san? Your...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.890
Yes. She was my friend, as a kid.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.850
And she's Principal Kumashiro
Jun'ichiro's only daughter.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.540
Kumashiro Maya.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.700
That's pretty wild...

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.360
She arrived late, to her own dad's funeral,
like it was no big deal.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.380
And wearing a white dress.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:32.390
But you know, she's actually as
good as the principal at-

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.850
The moment of silence is over.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:41.320
There's something I'd like you all to hear.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:45.650
This. It was found in the principal's desk.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:50.620
We listened to the beginning, and it's a
parting message from the principal to you all.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.830
In other words, the principal
knew he had little time.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:04.950
Please listen to the
principal's final message.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:09.790
My beloved students,

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:14.980
I imagine that my coffin lies before you.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:18.530
But inside is merely my physical body,
which has finished its task.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:23.480
My soul is about to embark on the
cosmic cycle's great journey.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.790
In accordance with universal
divine providence,

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:30.240
I shall undergo purification and rebirth.
And someday, you will see me again.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:34.220
I hope that you all will continue to
uphold our school's philosophy,

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:39.250
to seek the truth, as laid out by the
philosophies of Gustav Waldstein.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.370
You must not fear the occult.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:45.250
The truth lies in that from
which we avert our eyes.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:54.360
As proof, I shall show you something
that modern science cannot explain.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.780
I refer to...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.220
A spirit.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.180
Yesterday, while reading
a certain ancient text,

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:04.110
I stumbled upon a spell
for summoning a spirit.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.150
No, that's not it...

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.360
This isn't it, either.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.130
Ah, here we go.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.570
<i>San***s be****s co***s ed***s!</i>

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.280
<i>Ave S***ni!</i>

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.370
Whoops, wrong one...

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.510
That's the spell to summon
ancient spirits of the dead.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.390
What is this?

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.730
Who is it that disturbs my slumber?

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.940
Why do you disturb my slumber?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.960
Then I shall kill you!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.300
I shall drag you all to hell!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.600
Oh, no. Something's here!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.780
Oh, well. I'll finish this later.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.590
Tonight, I'm putting up a barrier
and going to sleep.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:26.830
Goodnight.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.650
It was a rehearsal?

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.250
Kawashima-sensei!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.310
What is this spirit really?

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.610
First, we must get the kids out of here!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.580
Where did they go?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.040
My glasses... My glasses!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.330
Kozue!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.310
This is what you ended up as.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.190
Silence!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:18.370
Everyone, wake up!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.520
There isn't any such thing as spirits!

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.410
This is...

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.190
This is...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.500
It's all staged!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.590
Staged?

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:27.750
That was staged?

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:35.980
You there!

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.090
Admit it!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.310
This was staged, right?

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.720
There's some trick, right?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.180
Anyway, this is all a fraud.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:48.440
Principal Kumashiro Jun'ichiro
was deceiving you all.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:49.940
Maya.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.940
To begin with, Gustav Waldstein defined
the "occult" as religious minorities

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.950
such as the Gnostics and Manicheans,

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.980
who were persecuted and declared heretics

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.910
by the era's political leaders
and mainstream faiths!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:07.080
In other words, Waldstein's study of the occult
is merely a type of archeology of religion!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.720
The principal simply took that and interpreted
it in the broadest possible sense to include

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.590
spirits, UFOs, and other supernatural
occurrences,

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.980
packaged in what is commonly
considered the "occult,"

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:19.840
and took advantage of your curiosity... And...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.530
Okay, got it.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.900
Everyone, get going!

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:41.240
You're not getting away!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.490
Maya!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:52.730
Hey, it's been five years, Ami.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:56.370
Hi... Wait! What's going on here, Maya?

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.380
You said this was staged?

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.320
Where'd he go?

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.890
The principal went outside.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.840
Oh, no.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.260
We need to hurry, or someone
will be its victim.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.220
Victim?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.960
You don't know?

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:11.060
People devoured by a departed spirit
become one themselves.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.000
Come on, hurry!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.490
It wasn't staged?

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.700
Which is it?

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:34.130
It looks like the principal escaped
into the main building.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:38.690
It won't be easy to find him
in a building of this size.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.840
First, we need to uncover the
departed spirit's identity.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:45.600
Um... "Sanguis bebimus corpus"...

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.810
It's a lamie.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:50.600
In ancient Egypt, there was a
lost civilization named Laroca.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:55.270
This spell revived a departed spirit,
called a lamie, that they feared.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.730
Wow! You're really smart!

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:01.700
Oh, I'm sorry. We just met.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.940
My name is Naruse Kozue.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.180
I'm one of Kuroki Ami-san's classmates.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.410
Thank you for saving me back there.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:13.150
Um, I'm sorry for your loss.

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.090
I really respected your father, the principal.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.700
That's why I came here.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.920
My grades are a bit below average, but when
I grow up, I want to be just like him-

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.690
You want to be a departed spirit?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.840
This is a school?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.830
Don't make me laugh.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.720
It's a theme park, filled with disgusting fakes.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.770
Graduating from here won't help you find a...

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:34.720
Um, back there, why did
you say it was all staged?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.900
No reason.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.240
You knew the spirit was real,
and you even knew what it was-

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.610
Because staged is staged!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.640
I'm back!

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:48.160
Found some people who
might be able to help.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.240
Come in.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.500
This is JK. An occult dowser.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.700
Hello!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.860
This is Smile.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:04.770
He's the school's mechanic. He's good
in a fight, so I brought him along.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:07.440
The principal now? What a pain.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:12.810
I just finished tossing out some kid who swore
he was Jack the Ripper's reincarnation.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.190
Aw, calm down.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.440
So, what can they do?

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.720
Got it!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.280
I've got it! I've got it!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.380
What's this?

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.100
Spirit dowsing.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:27.570
Supposedly, he can use it to locate the spirit.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.560
Ridiculous.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:32.220
Is <i>Porco Rosso</i> over there actually okay?

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.850
I like that.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:36.850
Leave it to me.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:37.710
No problem.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.270
Also, his ears are really good.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.360
Let's go.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:46.880
The main building's twenty floors,
made of stone, in the European style.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:53.060
He wanted a school that would, eventually,
cover elementary school through university.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.560
These classrooms are still empty.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.120
You okay, Maya?

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.570
Want to rest a bit?

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.980
No, thanks.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.430
What kind of girl is Maya-san?

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.280
What kind?

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.740
She knew exactly the type of spirit it was,
yet still called it staged.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:17.370
Well, I don't know what's happening either,
but Maya's always been...

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.130
And the girl said, "Am I pretty?"

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.380
Stop it!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:31.990
Nine... Ten... Eleven... Twelve... Thirteen...

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.270
It was true!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.850
Kokkuri-san, Kokkuri-san, come out.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.200
What's that?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:15:00.220
It was because of Maya that
I came here... So why...

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.630
Kozue?

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.050
I found the spiritual energy.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.210
It's coming this way!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.100
It's coming!

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:26.770
I'll kill you.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.070
I'll kill you all!

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.200
I'll kill you.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.650
It's screaming.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:36.200
Kozue!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.000
Get out of the way!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.340
My glasses... My glasses!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:16:00.300
Hey! Don't get cocky just 'cause
you're a little bit possessed!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.600
Not the face...

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.580
Smile!

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.600
That's useless.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.570
To stop a lamie, you have to find
the first person they possessed.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.110
What did you say?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.910
Maya...

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:20.310
Wait!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:21.930
Maya, don't go alone!

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.000
To kill a lamie...

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.260
Maya.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.310
Papa!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.050
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.710
You were right. It was all a trick.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.890
I planned it from the start.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:53.040
Why?

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:57.120
I thought you wouldn't come,
unless you thought I was dead.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.110
You and your mama, too.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.460
I missed you. Is your mama doing well?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.380
She died. Two years ago.

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.140
I see...

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:09.920
Forgive me.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:14.070
I spent so much time researching
the occult, building the school...

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:18.430
I neglected my family, neglected you.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.050
Papa.

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.880
I forgot about you.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.480
I'm a failure as a father.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.810
Stop it, Papa!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.580
It's okay, Papa.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.170
It's okay now...

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.650
Maya.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.620
Now, let's go.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.930
I want you to show me more
of the school you built.

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:52.550
That's right. We have a lot to talk about.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:57.710
Hey, Papa, did you know?

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.000
They say evil spirits can read
men's minds and souls,

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.470
to take advantage of their
deepest weaknesses.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.610
And to stop a lamie...

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.090
You have to cut off the head...

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:20.490
St-Stop it, Maya!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.830
...of the one it first possessed!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:49.690
Maya!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.400
Maya?

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:03.850
I...

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:11.250
I loved my father.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.710
What did you ask Santa Claus for?

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:17.840
I asked for...

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:21.180
He was the one who let me believe

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:25.020
in things that don't exist in our world,
that only the mind's eye can see.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:25.810
But...

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.270
Papa!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:31.110
You promised we'd go shopping.

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.730
Hey, Papa!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.690
Shut up, you brat!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.590
It drove my father mad...

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.970
This place, Occult Academy.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.670
This'll do it.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:00.460
Man, when she screamed at me,
I was scared out of my wits.

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.130
But she hasn't realized the truth yet.

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.200
She's the principal's daughter.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.600
We can't let down our guard.
We must stay vigilant.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.980
Right.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.530
The occult does nothing but destroy men.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:19.230
Someday, this school will
bring about disaster.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:23.840
The seeds of delusion will be sown,
and it will bring the whole world to ruin.

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:24.500
Before that happens...

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:34.540
I will destroy this school!
That's why I returned!

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.530
I hate...

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:44.800
<i>the occult!{i0}</i>

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.810
A cell phone?

00:21:58.470 --> 00:22:00.690
That was bright.

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:49.940
Welcome to Waldstein Academy.

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:51.490
Do you like the occult?

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:54.020
In this place, we study the
world's strange mysteries.

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:56.590
Everything from spiritual
phenomenon to psychic abilities,

00:23:56.590 --> 00:24:01.710
magic, UFOs, and ancient
super-civilizations to OOPArts.

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:02.760
We've got it all.

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:04.260
Now, what you'll see next time is-

00:24:04.260 --> 00:24:05.420
